          "id": 1285244192,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I don't think I still want it to be merged. It was in some random erroneously dissected capture file I was looking at that I'll have to find (or duplicate.) The vertical tab was almost certainly some kind of error, and it must have been in some protocol that calls `format_text_wsp` (of which there aren't many.) I think it's handled better in the current master branch than in the version I was using at the time.",
